{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, hope you're doing okay. Since we chatted last, I've been blogging about politics and the government. It's been a really satisfying experience and I care about making a real impact. We need way better education and infrastructure and I know firsthand how this impacts neighborhoods."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-3b56cd62530550603183bbca", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:05.728531+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b56cd62530550603183bbca", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b56cd62530550603183bbca", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, glad to hear you're fired up about something! Blogging can really make a difference. I agree that education and infrastructure are key to our community's growth."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-fea93af6d8bc19ed1d047786", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:09.873147+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fea93af6d8bc19ed1d047786", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fea93af6d8bc19ed1d047786", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! It's been great to talk to someone who understands the importance of these issues. Digging deeper into the political system has been eye-opening, so I'm researching policies and writing about my thoughts and ideas. Hoping to raise awareness and start conversations to create positive change."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-cb06d3e3d92ac208d9870b22", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:14.020383+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cb06d3e3d92ac208d9870b22", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cb06d3e3d92ac208d9870b22", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! Your hard work will definitely start conversations and create positive change. What policies have you been focusing on lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-8569a16959b5fcd6e710803d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:18.157423+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8569a16959b5fcd6e710803d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8569a16959b5fcd6e710803d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Recently, education reform and infrastructure development. Good access to quality education and updated infrastructure are key to a thriving and successful community. My goal is to get conversations going and get people involved by sharing ideas and taking action. It's really empowering to know I can help make a difference in people's lives."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-e8ad9314c84bade55b28f9a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:22.308003+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8ad9314c84bade55b28f9a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8ad9314c84bade55b28f9a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! Your passion and dedication is inspiring. It's great to see you taking the lead and making a difference. Keep up the amazing work!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-2123612f65075cc6004162b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:26.430262+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2123612f65075cc6004162b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2123612f65075cc6004162b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Really appreciate your support and encouragement, it means a lot to me. I've gotten some good feedback on my blog posts so far. It's just a small step, but every step counts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-cf2594d498aac2586deee660", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:30.516092+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf2594d498aac2586deee660", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf2594d498aac2586deee660", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: It seems like your post is having an effect. Who are they? They're having fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-4ab6698a7b48112dab9e876e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:34.629611+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ab6698a7b48112dab9e876e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ab6698a7b48112dab9e876e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: My colleagues and I went to a convention together last month. We're all passionate about using tech for good in our community. It was great to connect with like-minded folks and swap ideas. It's inspiring to see people united in their goal."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-a82c8505374e0570c909d9aa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:38.717953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a82c8505374e0570c909d9aa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a82c8505374e0570c909d9aa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, that must have been awesome! Being around people who share your passion is truly inspiring. How did it feel to be surrounded by like-minded individuals there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-f218f6bc966b35e97227b28c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:42.866128+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f218f6bc966b35e97227b28c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f218f6bc966b35e97227b28c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Talking with the group of people who were as stoked as me on tech for change was awesome! It made me think we really can make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-216d61101dacad5135d0365d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:46.951943+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "216d61101dacad5135d0365d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "216d61101dacad5135d0365d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No way, John! That's really cool. What was the most exciting part of it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-3d8cd6dd6189b30233999810", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:51.049340+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3d8cd6dd6189b30233999810", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3d8cd6dd6189b30233999810", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: The best part was the energy in the room - so infectious! We all had great ideas, brainstormed together, and stayed motivated. It was really empowering."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-eb7ab1a4de9e6ce8805b4c8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:55.197330+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eb7ab1a4de9e6ce8805b4c8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eb7ab1a4de9e6ce8805b4c8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That sounds amazing! How did being in that environment with such motivated people affect you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-8b6ef5816410542c868d689e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:46:59.319763+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8b6ef5816410542c868d689e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8b6ef5816410542c868d689e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: The motivated people around me gave me renewed energy and a purpose. It really inspired me to make a bigger difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-f945dc19dcf55a145d11acd2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:03.453706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f945dc19dcf55a145d11acd2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f945dc19dcf55a145d11acd2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Cool, John! It's inspiring to be around people like that. Anything exciting on the horizon?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-c8cfdccbb343831f8ae8566f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:07.541598+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c8cfdccbb343831f8ae8566f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c8cfdccbb343831f8ae8566f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm planning a trip to the East Coast. How about you? Anything cool going on recently?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-e67d03e7357df39e760e55ea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:11.633569+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e67d03e7357df39e760e55ea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e67d03e7357df39e760e55ea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I'm still volunteering at the homeless shelter. It's fulfilling to lend a hand."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-d9e4daed4a53d3a2ccd11e78", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:15.741549+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d9e4daed4a53d3a2ccd11e78", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d9e4daed4a53d3a2ccd11e78", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! You're so dedicated to helping people. How's it been going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-a5b99fba132c682d4bed9491", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:19.857836+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a5b99fba132c682d4bed9491", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a5b99fba132c682d4bed9491", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: It's been rewarding and tough. It's fulfilling, but the growing need for help can be overwhelming."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-5affcbcc63c74590b0af0383", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:23.988444+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5affcbcc63c74590b0af0383", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5affcbcc63c74590b0af0383", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It's tough sometimes, but every act of kindness matters. You're so dedicated and inspiring, Maria. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-b7ea4110470940f7cdd551c5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:28.074252+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b7ea4110470940f7cdd551c5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b7ea4110470940f7cdd551c5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John. Your kind words mean a lot. Little acts of kindness can have a big effect. We can all do something to make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-583a1f56ddd3f556cffe36b0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:32.227239+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "583a1f56ddd3f556cffe36b0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "583a1f56ddd3f556cffe36b0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You're right, every small act can make a big impact. Let's keep doing our part for the world!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-41/session_12-960d91a4e3535d048c03e1b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T13:47:36.335066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "960d91a4e3535d048c03e1b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "960d91a4e3535d048c03e1b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
